<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fa" dir="rtl">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <title>راهنمای مرحله ۱ | The Zero Secret</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #f1f8e8;
      color: #173B2A;
      font-family: Tahoma, Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 2;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 700px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 40px 22px;
    }

    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
    }

    .number {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #315C43;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin: 8px 0;
      color: #123524;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #315C43;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 1px solid #c8dcbc;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(23, 59, 42, 0.12);
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #123524;
    }

    p {
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 18px 0;
      color: #173B2A;
    }

    strong {
      color: #0E2B1D;
    }

    .highlight {
      border-right: 4px solid #315C43;
      padding: 12px 18px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      background: #f1f8e8;
      border-radius: 8px;
      color: #123524;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .note {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding: 18px;
      background: #e4f0d8;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #173B2A;
    }

    .note strong {
      color: #0E2B1D;
    }

    .start {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 35px;
      font-size: 18px;
      color: #123524;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 40px;
      color: #315C43;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="container">

    <div class="header">
      <div class="number">THE ZERO SECRET</div>
      <h1>راهنمای مرحله ۱</h1>
      <div class="subtitle">ماجرای سانتریفیوژها</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">

      <h2>zerodays</h2>

    
    </div>

    <footer>
      THE ZERO SECRET
    </footer>

  </div>

</body>
</html>
